              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "Because episode numbering can differ depending on the platform (such as Netflix, Disney Channel, or the original French broadcast order), \"Season 2, Episode 12\" refers to different episodes, but **all of them have already been released and are available to watch**. \n\n### If you mean Season 2, Episode 12:\nDepending on where you are watching, Season 2 Episode 12 corresponds to one of the following:\n\n*   **\"Sapotis\"** (Official Worldwide/French Broadcast Order): \n    *   **Release Date:** January 21, 2018\n    *   *Plot:* Alya's little sisters are akumatized into multiplying monsters, leading Ladybug to give Alya the Fox Miraculous so she can become Rena Rouge.\n*   **\"Captain Hardrock\"** (Netflix & Disney Channel US Order): \n    *   **Release Date:** March 30, 2018\n    *   *Plot:* Juleka's mother gets akumatized into a pirate captain. This episode also marks the first appearance of Luka Couffaine.\n*   **\"Gorizilla\"** (Canadian Family Channel Order): \n    *   **Release Date:** March 14, 2018\n    *   *Plot:* Adrien's bodyguard gets akumatized into a giant ape-like villain who chases Adrien across Paris.\n\nAll of these Season 2 episodes can be streamed on **Disney+** or **Netflix** (depending on your country).\n\n---\n\n### Did you mean Season 6, Episode 12?\nIf you made a typo and were looking for the newer **Season 6, Episode 12**:\n\n*   **Episode Title:** \"Wreckless Driver\" (*Psyconductrice*)\n*   **Release Dates:** \n    *   **October 8, 2025:** Released early on the French TF1+ app.\n    *   **October 12, 2025:** Aired on TFOU in France.\n    *   **November 15, 2025:** Aired on Disney Channel in the US.\n*   This episode has also already been released and is available on Disney+ in regions where Season 6 has rolled out.",
